# Only the gate's OWN files, not all of .github/ — owning the whole
# directory made one person the required reviewer for every unrelated
# workflow in the repo. These are the paths an author must not be able to
# weaken unreviewed. CODEOWNERS is LAST-match-wins, so this block belongs
# at the end of the file: it must outrank any broader `*` rule above it.
/.github/security/ @runpod/security
/.github/workflows/pr-security-scan.yml @runpod/security
/.github/workflows/pr-ai-review.yml @runpod/security
